        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: I Like Chopin, Velfarre 2000\n- Concepts: Italo disco\n- People: Aqua\n\nFacts:\n- Italo disco was a genre of music that was popular from the late 1970s to the late 1980s.\n- I Like Chopin is a song in the Italo disco genre.\n- Aqua is the artist of the song Velfarre 2000.\n- Velfarre 2000 is a hit song included in the Italo disco genre.",
